Step 1 — Establish the application architecture

Create the initial package structure and define the responsibilities of the Model, View, and Controller. No substantial implementation is necessary yet.




Step 2 — Implement database management

Create the SQLite schema, database creation/opening functions, and schema validation. Write unit tests to verify the database constraints.




Step 3 — Implement transaction operations

Develop and test the functions for adding, retrieving, updating, and deleting expenses, independently of the GUI.




Step 4 — Implement the PyQt6 interface

Create the main window, editable table, dependent dropdowns, menus, and description editor.




Step 5 — Integrate and test

Connect the GUI to the database operations, implement saving and discarding changes, and test the complete application.
